{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like parrying and deflection in games? WELL THAN THIS IS THE GAME FOR YOU!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ricochet Raven is a fast paced side scrolling roguelike where the only way you can attack enemies is by deflecting their projectiles back! This project is a passion project i made in my free time and plan on updating it to add more content!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002020/extras/c9e05939cd9811343db4eaf80f69daaf.poster.avif?t=1774625040\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002020/extras/c9e05939cd9811343db4eaf80f69daaf.webm?t=1774625040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002020/extras/c9e05939cd9811343db4eaf80f69daaf.mp4?t=1774625040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Features:</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced side scrolling action gameplay!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain dash jumps by deflecting mid air or dashing through destructible!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Dynamic deflecting effects based on power!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect upgrade feathers to gain abilities and build your style of fighting as you grow more powerful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002020/extras/736682183262a389da7a2ff2bf2180da.poster.avif?t=1774625040\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002020/extras/736682183262a389da7a2ff2bf2180da.webm?t=1774625040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002020/extras/736682183262a389da7a2ff2bf2180da.mp4?t=1774625040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Future Content?</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in early access. I play to keep updating and adding features to the game until I consider it complete! Hopefully crafting it into a fun experience with your feedback!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently I have a list of things I would like to add to the game, this list will change or increase based on recommendations of what to add to the game!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses:</strong> Every few levels a random boss will spawn which will also act as the end of a section and swap to another environment</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New environments:</strong> New Environments and levels will be added over time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More feathers:</strong> I plan on adding more feathers to the game increasing playstyle possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special zones:</strong>\u00a0Special areas that act as a deviation of the standard gameplay, these could be different special shops or a choice for the player to make that will change their loadout!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And more?</strong> Feel free to suggest what you would like to see!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002020/extras/484b75e9dd326d5709f8382963a8885b.poster.avif?t=1774625040\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002020/extras/484b75e9dd326d5709f8382963a8885b.webm?t=1774625040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002020/extras/484b75e9dd326d5709f8382963a8885b.mp4?t=1774625040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hi!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002020/extras/79898d6f715f04d52e4dcddec6c5c616.poster.avif?t=1774625040\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002020/extras/79898d6f715f04d52e4dcddec6c5c616.webm?t=1774625040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002020/extras/79898d6f715f04d52e4dcddec6c5c616.mp4?t=1774625040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002020?t=1774625040","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002020/33a03f2dcf8a146f966c0f559c34ba6e7a1b60da/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774625040","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002020/0f0abf004364304447c84dbe7a1a2846e50726cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774625040","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002020/0f0abf004364304447c84dbe7a1a2846e50726cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774625040","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4387180,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like parrying and deflection in games? WELL THAN THIS IS THE GAME FOR YOU!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ricochet Raven is a fast paced side scrolling roguelike where the only way you can attack enemies is by deflecting their projectiles back! This project is a passion project i made in my free time and plan on updating it to add more content!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002020/extras/c9e05939cd9811343db4eaf80f69daaf.poster.avif?t=1774625040\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002020/extras/c9e05939cd9811343db4eaf80f69daaf.webm?t=1774625040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002020/extras/c9e05939cd9811343db4eaf80f69daaf.mp4?t=1774625040\" type=\"vide