wap to another environment</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New environments:</strong> New Environments and levels will be added over time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More feathers:</strong> I plan on adding more feathers to the game increasing playstyle possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special zones:</strong>\u00a0Special areas that act as a deviation of the standard gameplay, these could be different special shops or a choice for the player to make that will change their loadout!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And more?</strong> Feel free to suggest what you would like to see!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002020/extras/484b75e9dd326d5709f8382963a8885b.poster.avif?t=1774625040\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002020/extras/484b75e9dd326d5709f8382963a8885b.webm?t=1774625040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002020/extras/484b75e9dd326d5709f8382963a8885b.mp4?t=1774625040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=